# 12. MCP Configuration

The MCP configuration for this environment is managed globally at:

`~/.cursor/mcp.json`

- Refer to this file for all MCP-related settings and integrations — exactly one MCP config per agent, no duplicates
- Stdio launcher scripts are shared with Claude Code and live in `~/.local/share/dotfiles/scripts/` (`jira-mcp.sh`, `sonarqube-mcp.sh`) — edit them there, never fork a per-agent copy
- Claude Code's equivalent config is `~/.claude/mcp-servers.json`; keep the two server lists in step when adding or removing a server
- Do not duplicate or commit sensitive configuration in project repositories
- When updating MCP integrations, always update the global config file, not project files

